# Receipt Schema

## Purpose
Define the minimal, canonical structure of a HALO receipt.
This document establishes what a receipt *is* at the level of intent and invariants,
not how it is stored, validated, or rendered.

## Non-Goals
- This is not an implementation.
- This does not define storage format (JSON, DB, etc.).
- This does not specify UI, APIs, or tooling.
- This does not enumerate all possible fields.
- This does not optimize for any specific platform or vendor.


